    "PROJECT_NAME": "torn-education-scheduler",
    "PROJECT_SUMMARY": "A Tampermonkey userscript that turns Torn's education page into a live planner: it reads your own course progress and time-reduction perks, lets you pick a set of courses, and computes the exact finish date for the whole path. Runs only on torn.com's education page, with a collapsible themed panel modelled on Torn Bookie Live Scores."
